{"id":"4beb5057b658d9d9","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-concatenated-code-distance.md","title":"Distance Product under Concatenation","display":"prop-concatenated-code-distance — Distance Product under Concatenation","type":"proposition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-concatenated-code-distance","aliases":["28-prop-concatenated-code-distance"],"type":"proposition","display":"prop-concatenated-code-distance — Distance Product under Concatenation","depends_on":["[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 19.13; Claim 19.14 and its generalization","source_printed_pages":"384","source_pdf_pages":"410","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-concatenated-code-distance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-concatenated-code-distance</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-concatenated-code-distance — Distance Product under Concatenation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 19.13; Claim 19.14 and its generalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"384"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"410"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\)</span> 为至少含两个元素的有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_1:A^n\\to\\Sigma^m\">\\(E_1:A^n\\to\\Sigma^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_2:\\Sigma\\to\\Gamma^k\">\\(E_2:\\Sigma\\to\\Gamma^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_1,\\delta_2\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\delta_1,\\delta_2\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E_1;\\delta_1)\">\\(\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E_1;\\delta_1)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s,t\\in\\Sigma\\ (s\\ne t\\Rightarrow\\Delta_k^\\Gamma(E_2(s),E_2(t))\\ge\\delta_2)\">\\(\\forall s,t\\in\\Sigma\\ (s\\ne t\\Rightarrow\\Delta_k^\\Gamma(E_2(s),E_2(t))\\ge\\delta_2)\\)</span>；相关符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_2\">\\(E_2\\)</span> 的输入是一个符号；下式是逐符号级联，不是将整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 长字直接送入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_2\">\\(E_2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2):A^n\\to\\Gamma^{mk},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2)(a)_{(j-1)k+t}\\coloneqq E_2(E_1(a)_j)_t\n\\quad(j\\in[m],\\ t\\in[k]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2):A^n\\to\\Gamma^{mk},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2)(a)_{(j-1)k+t}\\coloneqq E_2(E_1(a)_j)_t\n\\quad(j\\in[m],\\ t\\in[k]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,mk}^{A,\\Gamma}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2);\\delta_1\\delta_2\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,mk}^{A,\\Gamma}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2);\\delta_1\\delta_2\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 19.13、Claim 19.14及其后一般化文字（印刷384页/PDF410页）的陈述与分块计数证明均已核对。先用外码输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个符号，再分别用内码输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 长块，所以输出长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mk\">\\(mk\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\ldots,mk\">\\(1,\\ldots,mk\\)</span> 唯一写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(j-1)k+t\">\\((j-1)k+t\\)</span>，故级联构造为良定义全函数。不同输入的外码至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_1m\">\\(\\delta_1m\\)</span> 个符号不同；每个这样的块内至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_2k\">\\(\\delta_2k\\)</span> 个坐标不同。相乘后至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_1\\delta_2mk\">\\(\\delta_1\\delta_2mk\\)</span> 个不同坐标，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mk\">\\(mk\\)</span> 即得结论。零距离参数也覆盖，结论不暗中要求单射。</p>\n<p>本节点推广到任意有限输出字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>；原书使用二元内码。取外码 Reed–Solomon、内码 Walsh–Hadamard 即恢复原书主要实例，但该实例没有成为本命题的额外前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E_1;\\delta_1)$，且 $\\forall s,t\\in\\Sigma\\ (s\\ne t\\Rightarrow\\Delta_k^\\Gamma(E_2(s),E_2(t))\\ge\\delta_2)$；相关符号见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\Sigma,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"E_1:A^n\\to\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"E_2:\\Sigma\\to\\Gamma^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_1,\\delta_2\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E_1;\\delta_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s,t\\in\\Sigma\\ (s\\ne t\\Rightarrow\\Delta_k^\\Gamma(E_2(s),E_2(t))\\ge\\delta_2)","display":false},{"tex":"E_2","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"E_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2):A^n\\to\\Gamma^{mk},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2)(a)_{(j-1)k+t}\\coloneqq E_2(E_1(a)_j)_t\n\\quad(j\\in[m],\\ t\\in[k]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,mk}^{A,\\Gamma}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Concat}(E_1,E_2);\\delta_1\\delta_2\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"mk","display":false},{"tex":"1,\\ldots,mk","display":false},{"tex":"(j-1)k+t","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_1m","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_2k","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_1\\delta_2mk","display":false},{"tex":"mk","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2239,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fb76a370ebde152b"]}